{
  "slug": "idea-to-deploy",
  "name": "Idea To Deploy",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Full-cycle development methodology for Claude Code: from idea to production deployment. 17 skills covering project creation (/kickstart, /blueprint), daily\nworkflow (/debug, /test, /refactor, /perf), documentation (/doc, /guide), and session persistence (/session-save). 5 specialized sub-agents (architect, code-reviewer, test-generator, perf-analyzer, doc-writer). Opinionated but flexible — works with any stack.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **25 skills** and **7 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (25): `adopt` (Adopt legacy project into idea-to-deploy methodology — add CLAUDE.md, register project-level hooks in .claude/settings.json, bootstrap memory dir), `advisor` (Advisory/consulting mode — analysis and recommendations only, no code changes), `autopilot` (Auto-pipeline: runs the full methodology chain (discover → blueprint → kickstart → review → test) with minimal human…), `blueprint` (Generate project documentation set (strategic plan, architecture, implementation plan, PRD, README, guide)), `bugfix` (Systematically debug an issue — find root cause and fix it), `deploy` (Deploy to production — sync files, build containers, apply migrations, verify health), `deps-audit` (Audit third-party dependencies for known CVEs, license issues, and abandoned packages), `discover` (Product discovery phase — market analysis, user personas, competitor research, feature prioritization (MoSCoW + RICE)), and 17 more\n- **Agents** (7): `architect` (Specialized agent for project architecture design), `business-analyst` (Product discovery specialist — market analysis, user personas, competitor research, feature prioritization (MoSCoW + RICE)), `code-reviewer` (Specialized agent for cross-document and code validation), `devils-advocate` (Adversarial architecture reviewer — challenges architectural decisions, finds weaknesses, proposes alternatives), `doc-writer` (Specialized agent for documentation generation), `perf-analyzer` (Specialized agent for performance analysis and optimization), `test-generator` (Specialized agent for comprehensive test generation)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install idea-to-deploy@claude-community` from `HiH-DimaN/idea-to-deploy`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 25,
    "agent": 7
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
